      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 9,
          "section": "Conclusion",
          "quote": "(1) The top surface of SEBM (FeCoNi)86Al7Ti7 HEA presents an equiaxed grain, however, the SEBM (FeCoNi)86Al7Ti7 HEA showed coarse columnar grains along the building direction. A strong <100>//BD fiber texture can be observed on the top and side surfaces. SEBM (FeCoNi)86Al7Ti7 HEA dominantly consisted of ordered L12, disordered face-centered cubic (fcc) matrix phases and L21 phase, the L12 phase, and L21 phase precipitated in the top surface of SEBM (FeCoNi)86Al7Ti7 HEA, displaying granular-shaped morphologies and island-like shaped, respectively.",
          "table": null,
